WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:05.752
Add a student

00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:08.741
Open Management, then Students.

00:00:13.552 --> 00:00:15.451
Press Add Student.

00:00:17.668 --> 00:00:26.016
Choose the class and enter the student name. The roll number is suggested for you. Then add the parent name and phone.

00:00:34.484 --> 00:00:37.858
Save, and the student appears in the list.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:44.873
Use the class filter to see one class. Large lists can be imported from Excel.

00:00:45.948 --> 00:00:51.433
Student added
